{"seq":1,"slug":"cooperation-competition","title":"合作与竞争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/emergence/cooperation-competition","wordCount":1489,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"合作与竞争\">合作与竞争</h1><p>前两章假定智能体被一个好心的设计者编排着协作。但真实多智能体世界没那么和谐：每个智能体可能有自己的目标，它们的利益既可能一致也可能对立。为什么自利的智能体有时会自发合作、有时却一起掉进对谁都不利的陷阱？这需要一套刻画「多个理性主体互相影响」的数学语言——博弈论。这一篇集中讲全 hub 所有博弈论的核心概念，它是理解多智能体动态的理论底座。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>博弈</strong>（game）是对「多个决策者的行动共同决定每个人收益」这一情形的形式化。一个博弈由三要素构成：参与者（players）、每个参与者的策略集（strategies）、以及把策略组合映射到收益的收益函数（payoffs）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[博弈] --&gt; B[参与者]&#10;  A --&gt; C[策略集]&#10;  A --&gt; D[收益函数]&#10;  A --&gt; E{利益关系}&#10;  E --&gt;|完全对立| F[零和博弈&lt;br/&gt;我之得即你之失]&#10;  E --&gt;|部分一致| G[一般和博弈&lt;br/&gt;可双赢可双输]&#10;  E --&gt;|完全一致| H[纯合作博弈&lt;br/&gt;共同目标]&#10;  G --&gt; I[纳什均衡&lt;br/&gt;无人愿单方偏离]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  F --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[博弈] --&gt; B[参与者]\n  A --&gt; C[策略集]\n  A --&gt; D[收益函数]\n  A --&gt; E{利益关系}\n  E --&gt;|完全对立| F[零和博弈&lt;br/&gt;我之得即你之失]\n  E --&gt;|部分一致| G[一般和博弈&lt;br/&gt;可双赢可双输]\n  E --&gt;|完全一致| H[纯合作博弈&lt;br/&gt;共同目标]\n  G --&gt; I[纳什均衡&lt;br/&gt;无人愿单方偏离]\n  H --&gt; I\n  F --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>博弈类型</th>\n<th>利益关系</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>多智能体对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>零和</td>\n<td>完全对立</td>\n<td>围棋、扑克</td>\n<td>对抗性自博弈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般和</td>\n<td>部分一致</td>\n<td>囚徒困境</td>\n<td>多数现实协作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯合作</td>\n<td>完全一致</td>\n<td>共同搬运</td>\n<td>CTDE 下的协作 MARL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复博弈</td>\n<td>多轮交互</td>\n<td>重复囚徒困境</td>\n<td>长期智能体关系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"囚徒困境-为什么理性导致集体次优\">囚徒困境：为什么理性导致集体次优</h2><p>博弈论里最著名的故事是<strong>囚徒困境</strong>：两个共犯被分开审讯，各自面临「合作（沉默）」或「背叛（招供）」。收益矩阵如下（数字为各自的「年数损失」的负值，越大越好）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>甲＼乙</th>\n<th>乙合作</th>\n<th>乙背叛</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>甲合作</td>\n<td>(-1, -1)</td>\n<td>(-3, 0)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>甲背叛</td>\n<td>(0, -3)</td>\n<td>(-2, -2)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论对方怎么选，背叛对每个个体都更优（占优策略），于是两人都背叛，落到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-2,-2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——而双方合作本可得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-1,-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这就是个体理性导致集体次优的经典悖论。它精准刻画了多智能体协作的根本张力：没有恰当机制，自利的智能体会蹬向对所有人都更差的结局。前面<a href=\"../collaboration/negotiation-consensus\">协商与共识</a>里的种种机制，本质都是在化解这种困境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"纳什均衡-博弈的稳定点\">纳什均衡：博弈的稳定点</h2><p>刻画博弈结局的核心概念是<strong>纳什均衡</strong>（Nash equilibrium）：一个策略组合，其中每个参与者在他人策略不变时都没有单方面改变策略的动机。形式上，策略组合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(s_1^*, \\dots, s_n^*)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是纳什均衡，当且仅当对每个参与者 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 与任意可选策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_i(s_i^*, s_{-i}^*) \\ge u_i(s_i, s_{-i}^*)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0553em;vertical-align:-0.3053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0553em;vertical-align:-0.3053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的收益，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{-i}^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0057em;vertical-align:-0.317em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.317em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示其他人的均衡策略。囚徒困境里「双方背叛」就是唯一纳什均衡。纳什均衡的关键洞见是：均衡不等于最优——一个稳定的结局可能对所有人都不好。这正是多智能体系统可能「自发陷入糟糕状态」的理论解释，也是<a href=\"marl\">多智能体强化学习</a>里收敛分析的核心对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重复博弈与合作的演化\">重复博弈与合作的演化</h2><p>如果囚徒困境只玩一次，背叛是理性的。但若<strong>重复多次</strong>且对方记得你上次的行为，故事就变了——合作可能涌现。Robert Axelrod 著名的竞赛显示，简单的「<strong>针锋相对</strong>」（tit-for-tat：首轮合作，之后复制对方上一轮的动作）策略表现极佳：它善良（不先背叛）、可激怒（背叛必报复）、宽容（对方回头就恢复合作）。</p>\n<p>重复博弈揭示了合作的演化机制：<strong>未来的阴影</strong>。当智能体预期还要长期打交道，背叛的短期收益会被未来报复的长期损失抵消，合作于是成为理性选择。这对长期运行的大模型多智能体系统有直接启示——智能体间建立可追溯的声誉与历史，能内生地激励合作，无需中心强制。这种自发涌现的合作，是<a href=\"emergent-behavior\">涌现行为</a>的一个核心案例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"机制设计-反过来设计博弈\">机制设计：反过来设计博弈</h2><p>博弈论分析「给定规则，理性者会怎么做」；<strong>机制设计</strong>（mechanism design）反过来问「想让理性者做出我们想要的行为，该设计什么规则」。它是博弈论的「逆向工程」，也是多智能体协调最强大的工具之一。</p>\n<p>机制设计的目标通常是让「说真话/做对的事」成为参与者的占优策略，即<strong>激励相容</strong>。<a href=\"../collaboration/negotiation-consensus\">协商与共识</a>里维克里拍卖让如实出价成为占优策略，就是激励相容机制的典范；<a href=\"../foundations/coordination-models\">协调模型</a>里的市场机制能否高效配置资源，也取决于其底层机制设计的优劣。在大模型多智能体里，机制设计体现为如何设置奖励、声誉、惩罚，引导一群自利智能体走向合作而非困境——把上一节「未来阴影」从偶然变成必然。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>博弈论刻画「多个理性主体的行动共同决定彼此收益」，三要素：参与者、策略集、收益函数；利益关系分零和、一般和、纯合作。</li>\n<li>囚徒困境揭示个体理性导致集体次优的根本张力，是多智能体协作所有困难的理论原型。</li>\n<li>纳什均衡是「无人愿单方偏离」的稳定点，但稳定不等于最优——解释了系统为何会自发陷入糟糕状态。</li>\n<li>重复博弈中合作能涌现，靠「未来的阴影」与针锋相对式策略；启示长期智能体系统应建立声誉与历史以内生激励合作。</li>\n<li>机制设计是博弈论的逆向工程，目标是让「做对的事」成为占优策略（激励相容），是协调的最强工具，贯穿拍卖、市场与奖励设计。</li>\n<li>博弈论是理解涌现、MARL 与协商的共同底座，把「自利如何走向协作」这一全 hub 张力数学化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合作与竞争","id":"合作与竞争"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"囚徒困境：为什么理性导致集体次优","id":"囚徒困境-为什么理性导致集体次优"},{"level":2,"text":"纳什均衡：博弈的稳定点","id":"纳什均衡-博弈的稳定点"},{"level":2,"text":"重复博弈与合作的演化","id":"重复博弈与合作的演化"},{"level":2,"text":"机制设计：反过来设计博弈","id":"机制设计-反过来设计博弈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"编排模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/collaboration/orchestration-patterns"},"next":{"title":"涌现行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/emergence/emergent-behavior"}}